        "id": "U7-D2",
        "statement": "Active holds are stored in a new LedgerState field Holds: Map\u003Cstring, Hold\u003E, keyed by hold id, with a new record Hold = { HeldAccount: AccountId; HeldAmount: decimal }. Keying by id makes two active holds with one id unrepresentable, so the cross-account DuplicateHold rule is a key lookup. Releasing removes the key, so a released id is free for reuse and no released-hold history is kept. Ledger.empty starts it empty; only placeHold and releaseHold change it. Adding a field is source-breaking only for LedgerState record literals; only Ledger.empty builds one in this repository.",
