        "statement": "available is Ledger.balance (which gives the UnknownAccount refusal for accounts not open, including closed ones) minus the sum of the account\u0027s active holds. placeHold checks InvalidAmount, then UnknownAccount via available, then DuplicateHold, then InsufficientFunds (amount \u003E available, so placing exactly the available amount is allowed). releaseHold checks only the hold id; it does not check whether the hold\u0027s account is still open.",
